    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Bilé's secret childe of only ten years, Michael Brandeis is publicly presented as the brood's leading Ventrue while his own sire poses as his aged counselor and servant. Abused and psychologically dominated by Bilé since his Embrace, Michael is only beginning to suspect that he is being groomed as a lightning rod &mdash; a public face meant to draw fire and blame while his sire's real machinations continue unseen &mdash; and is starting, quietly and fearfully, to consider rebellion.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Portray Michael as outwardly confident and every inch the young, ambitious Ventrue on the rise, but privately anxious, second-guessing himself, and flinching from his 'counselor's' disapproval. Seeds of doubt about his sire can be played as growing paranoia rather than open defiance &mdash; he isn't ready to act yet.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, convert to owned Discipline Items at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Presence 4, Dominate 2.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: João Bilé (secret; posing publicly as Michael's aged counselor/servant). Embrace: 1989. Part of Sample Brood: Bilé's Gambit, Clanbook: Ventrue, Chapter Three.",
